* German Ultra preamp, stage 1 of 5: the guitar, V1a (shared by both channels), the optocoupler switches and the input networks of both channels
* (the GAIN pot P1 of the Overdrive channel with its bright capacitors, and the clean channel's BASS, R302, R301 and GAIN P7). The Overdrive
* channel continues in stage 2 from the node od3 (before the grid stopper R8), the clean channel in stage 4 from the node w7 (the grid of V4b).
* Transcribed from a schematic of the 120 W two-channel head (see CHANGELOG). Each stage carries the supply decoupling of the whole preamp (R33 / K22,
* R34 / K21, R32 / K20) and dummy loads for the currents the other stages draw, so the DC points are those of the single netlist.
* Units: k M, m u n p. Node "0" is ground. See engine/include/sas/netlist.h for the format.

V VRAIL x 100 470
I VIN gin 1
R RSRC gin in 7k
R RPU1 gin pkb1 1e12
.xfmr LPU1 L=2.5
  W pkb1 in 1 pu
.end
R RPU2 gin pkb2 1e12
.xfmr LPU2 L=5
  W pkb2 in 1 pu
.end
C CPU gin in 110p
R RPL gin in 1e12
R SWK1 in pkk1 1e12
C CCAB1 pkk1 0 200p
R SWK2 in pkk2 1e12
C CCAB2 pkk2 0 400p
R SWK4 in pkk4 1e12
C CCAB4 pkk4 0 800p
R R33 x nA 10k
C K22 nA 0 30u
R R34 nA nB 10k
C K21 nB 0 30u
R R32 nB nC 6.8k
C K20 nC 0 20u
R Rdummy_nC nC 0 202k
R Rdummy_nB nB 0 99.8k
R Rdummy_nA nA 0 72.1k
R R1 in 0 1M
R R2 in g1 68k
T V1A g1 p1 k1 12AX7
R R5 nC p1 180k
C C200 g1 p1 22p
R R6 k1 0 1.8k
C K6 k1 0 4.7u
C C1 p1 pc 100n
R SW_OC2 pc od1 1
R SW_OC1 pc cl1 1e12
C K5 od1 od2 2.2n
C K4 od2 0 2.2n
R VR1T od2 w1 1
R VR1B w1 0 1
C C201 od2 w1 1n
C C202 od2 w1 100p
C K24 w1 od3 22n
R R9 od3 0 68k
R R303 cl1 q 499k
C C305 cl1 q 220p
C C306 cl1 c6 3.3n
R R304 c6 q 499k
R R302 q cq 499k
C C303 cl1 cq 47p
R VR8 q 0 1
R R301 cq t7 100k
C C301 cq t7 470p
R VR7T t7 w7 1
R VR7B w7 0 1
C C302 t7 w7 47p
